## Intent & Decisions
The user asked to look up experimental Code Mode for Claude Code, set its env var in this repo, commit, and push. The agent added only CLAUDE_CODE_EXPERIMENTAL_CODE_MODE=1 to the env block of claude_settings.json. The agent did not remove CLAUDE_CODE_EXPERIMENTAL_AGENT_TEAMS, because dropping a feature the user has enabled is the user's decision.

## Actions & Verification
