## Findings & Constraints
Source: https://code.claude.com/docs/en/code-mode.md and env-vars.md, read by a claude-code-guide subagent. Requires Claude Code v2.1.323+; installed CLI was 2.1.325 and its binary contains the variable name. Docs say the variable is ignored in project settings files and must be in ~/.claude/settings.json; that file is a symlink to claude_settings.json in this repo, so the setting applies. Docs list these as blocking Code Mode startup: agent teams, API key helper, custom ANTHROPIC_BASE_URL, OpenTelemetry export, DISABLE_TELEMETRY. Remote Control, Claude in Chrome, and computer use are unavailable in Code Mode; this settings file has remoteControlAtStartup true. Code Mode sessions can be resumed only with the variable set to 1. First session shows an opt-in prompt.

## Relevant Files & Commits
lib/claude.sh: installer that merges claude_settings.json into ~/.claude/settings.json.

